# class: docs-site
# schema: id | kind | summary | source
# source-glob: docs/_config.yml + docs/Gemfile + docs/index.md + docs/getting-started.md
# recipe: novel
# authored: 2026-05-23
# Recipe: extract site identity (title/url/baseurl/repository/theme/search), nav inventory (every front-matter title + nav_order across docs/*.md to provide a single ToC view), Gemfile dependency pin, .github/workflows/pages.yml gate conditions.

site-identity | site-config | title=Deployment Dashboard; url=https://kostiantyn-matsebora.github.io; baseurl=/deployment-dashboard; repository=kostiantyn-matsebora/deployment-dashboard; remote_theme=just-the-docs/just-the-docs; search_enabled=true; color_scheme=light; mermaid=10.9.1 | @docs/_config.yml
site-excludes | site-config | Excludes from Jekyll build: Gemfile, Gemfile.lock, vendor, ui/deployment-dashboard.html (HTML mockup is not a doc page) | @docs/_config.yml:exclude
site-aux-links | site-config | Aux links: Get Started -> /deployment-dashboard/getting-started; GitHub Repo -> https://github.com/kostiantyn-matsebora/deployment-dashboard | @docs/_config.yml:aux_links
site-nav-external | site-config | External nav link: Built with ginee -> https://github.com/kostiantyn-matsebora/ginee | @docs/_config.yml:nav_external_links
site-footer | site-config | Footer: "Deployment Dashboard - built end-to-end by AI via ginee. Pre-1.0 - APIs may change." | @docs/_config.yml:footer_content
gemfile-pin | dependency-pin | source: https://rubygems.org; jekyll-remote-theme (Just the Docs via remote_theme); jekyll-seo-tag; jekyll-default-layout; github-pages gem for GitHub Pages compatibility | @docs/Gemfile
nav-index | nav-inventory | Nav order across docs/: index.md (nav_order=1) / getting-started.md (nav_order=2) / install.md (nav_order=3) / features.md (nav_order=4) / ci-cd-integration.md (nav_order=5 approx) / ci-cd-pipelines.md (nav_order=11 approx) / integration-tests.md (nav_order=12) / WBS.md (nav_order=9) / architecture.md; UI Options parent group with child option docs (nav_order=6-7 per file front-matter); ADRs parent group; CRs parent group | @docs/*.md (front-matter nav_order fields)
pages-ci | workflow-gate | .github/workflows/pages.yml gates on successful Jekyll build + deploy to GitHub Pages; fires on push:main + workflow_dispatch; permissions: contents:read + pages:write + id-token:write; deploy environment: github-pages | @.github/workflows/pages.yml
index-page | nav-inventory | docs/index.md (nav_order=1): landing page with mermaid architecture diagram + overview sections (What it is / What it tracks / How it connects) + links to SAD / getting-started; uses mermaid fences enabled by _config.yml mermaid.version=10.9.1 | @docs/index.md
getting-started-page | nav-inventory | docs/getting-started.md (nav_order=2): 60-second evaluator path (demo-default + Windows PowerShell + Linux/macOS + what you see within 60s + next steps links) | @docs/getting-started.md
